sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis session/cache
    participant API as Roadmap service
    participant Graph as Roadmap StateGraph
    participant R as Roadmap agent
    participant Resource as Resource agent
    participant LLM as ChatGroq
    participant YT as YouTube Data API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    UI->>GW: POST /api/roadmap/generate
    GW->>Redis: Validate session
    Redis-->>GW: Session identity
    GW->>API: Proxy + x-user-id
    API->>Graph: invoke(role, package, optional resume)
    Graph->>R: Static edge: roadmapAgent
    R->>LLM: Generate structured roadmap
    LLM-->>R: Roadmap JSON text
    R-->>Graph: Parsed and normalized roadmap state
    Graph->>Resource: Static edge: resourceAgent
    Resource->>LLM: Request article recommendations
    LLM-->>Resource: Article JSON text
    loop Each roadmap module
        Resource->>YT: Search FreeCodeCamp, then fallback if needed
        YT-->>Resource: Video result or no result
    end
    Resource-->>Graph: Enriched/mutated roadmap state
    Graph-->>API: Graph result (output shape caveat documented)
    API->>DB: Create roadmap record
    API->>Redis: Invalidate list; cache detail (one hour)
    API-->>UI: Created roadmap response
